    "题干": "已知 $\\log_{2020}\\bigl[\\log_{9}\\bigl(\\log_{3}x\\bigr)\\bigr] = 0$，那么 $x^{-\\frac{1}{9}} = \\, \\underline{\\hspace{3cm}}$。",
    "难度（1-5）": "4",
    "知识点标签": "对数运算;求值",
    "解析": "答案: $\\dfrac{1}{3}$   解析: 因为 $\\log_{2020}\\big[\\log_{9}\\big(\\log_{3}x\\big)\\big] = 0$，所以 $\\log_{9}\\big(\\log_{3}x\\big) = 1$，所以 $\\log_{3}x = 9$，所以 $x = 3^{9}$；因此 $x^{-\\frac{1}{9}} = \\big(3^{9}\\big)^{-\\frac{1}{9}} = 3^{-1} = \\dfrac{1}{3}$。",
